e Republican Doug Ollivant has raised under $400,000 with about $109,000 available. Three minor-party and independent candidates are on the ballot but are poorly funded and unlikely to be consequential.\n\nNo public general-election polls are available, so the outlook rests on fundamentals: the district's partisan lean, Vindman's incumbency and financial dominance, and a strong Democratic national environment. Expert raters unanimously place the race in the Safe or Solid Democratic column, and prediction markets price a Democratic win near 96%. Local coverage has centered on affordability and energy costs, themes both campaigns emphasize, but nothing suggests a competitive race.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.972, "margin": 13.04}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9562, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9664, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9683, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9585, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9406, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.9612, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9637, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9667, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9827, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9791, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9746, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9559, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9685, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9681, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9696, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9686, "margin": 12.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9744, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9771, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9687, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9709, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9722, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9485, "mar